From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:52:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: search chats and mentions by alias

Local dialog search and the @-mention autocomplete now resolve
username aliases, so an alias is enough to find a chat or tag a
person. Needs 0072.
---
